              "tweet_ids": [],
              "id": "1a.3"
            },
            {
              "text": "Following displacement in Cranmoor, response operations included road repairs by Yelverton Minerals, restoration of services in <PERSON>, delivery of aid, community support initiatives, and regulatory meetings with the mines inspectorate.",
